					"uidString" : "3TEPrKRrRjCy/EB0n+ZFPg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Loving the ideas presented by <https://objective.st/About> is not enough.\nGood presentation <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vrD3TrVuiV0>\nGarlan et al <https://john.cs.olemiss.edu/~hcc/csci658/notes/localcopy/ArchitecturalMismatch.pdf>\nfllowup <https://repository.upenn.edu/server/api/core/bitstreams/f20376b9-f992-4bd9-9c5c-ace580c14898/content> STUK talk <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IlTWe-eVjVQ&t=1283s>\nAdditional tweaks to the compiler <https://github.com/dvmason/Pharo-Functional>\nPresentation <https://archive.esug.org/ESUG2022/03Wednesday/04-dmason.pdf>\nFirst time I read the phrase <https://blog.metaobject.com/2019/>"
			},
